{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A stone is dropped into a well and the report of the stone striking the bottom is heard <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/1/af199908464ee5113a36cb1146cf2235e4011879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> seconds after it is dropped. Assume that the stone falls <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/d/68d851f3b4678a2dea7f9fd02a68f42742459468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16t^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> feet in t seconds and that the velocity of sound is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/8/5488790b7b51ff0c06b2c63624fdba37b6775379.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1120$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> feet per second. The depth of the well is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/c/12cf666f4a594d108ad013d6e7ae2a76440f1281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 784\\text{ ft.}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 342\\text{ ft.}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1568\\text{ ft.}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 156.8\\text{ ft.}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"618\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the depth of the well in feet, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b91b7245b0dd42b4f5585b97e323a8cfaa064a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be the number of seconds the rock took to fall to the bottom of the well, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a40dccc3bb61d55c03b7dafe15707eeef43885ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /> be the number of seconds the sound took to travel back up the well. We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/6/ff6318b02739ddc47ad0a32cf521d289890fc9ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1+t_2=7.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"14\" />. Now we can solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b91b7245b0dd42b4f5585b97e323a8cfaa064a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2a5fec1f25b11a7ea99e02fce3a42d8ba4de73.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d=16t_1^2\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc46148684a7a6a6e76fc59bef32a71975bc4ff5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{d}{16}=t_1^2\\]\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d962f9e81da97da1b218196bd4d0b7a31188fcd0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{d}}4\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"41\" />\nAnd similarly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a40dccc3bb61d55c03b7dafe15707eeef43885ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e35f7f7c4254298729bb6607a17c17d0b4eae50.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d=1120t_2\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848a7dd43ac97f5d2f3c9146d6130173740e933d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_2=\\frac{d}{1120}\\]\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e84d28be9393f647dc7697cadaa986bc1c70fa99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{1120}+\\frac{\\sqrt{d}}4-7.7=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"169\" height=\"42\" />. If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/60424ae985b4717cc4f1220d4dcb057463e226ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=\\sqrt{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />, this becomes a quadratic. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/3427ff46b91ac2735ebd93fe1ff59db88b4749ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{u^2}{1120}+\\frac{u}4-7.7=0\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6ce6927c41b22bc1c0a357fb8374274adc1e96f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=\\frac{-\\frac14\\pm\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^2-4(\\frac1{1120})(-7.7)}}{\\frac2{1120}}\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"58\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/4/984c113b985348cea1e8e53565d257ce3fc153a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=560\\cdot\\left(-\\frac14\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac1{16}+\\frac{7.7}{280}}\\right)\\]\" width=\"241\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9df4945ef343c0a12b48d61ac95cc1f244dc2b0a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=560\\cdot\\left(-\\frac14\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{400}}\\right)\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4d0b0aa1cccb75fd57a6bfd601262b07d63014.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=560\\cdot\\left(-\\frac14\\pm\\frac3{10}\\right)\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"43\" />\nWe know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the positive square root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we can replace the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/91205e81c98c486418902c88d5c396f5355491f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/2687c6a4efddeec600052d4bda65184426086b96.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=560\\cdot\\left(\\frac1{20}\\right)\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f16dad7885d9f3f1b2b5c8ff9526b9e06ef0dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=\\frac{560}{20}\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/4466d6e82a14095b8b87e275ad36d824ffd20fc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u=28\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />\nThen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/d/9fd8e89159f4afd3885d4d27862d86b1a7c03e40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=28^2=784$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1951 AHSME Pro